{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫藝人鄧凱文（Eris）一直以亮麗的外貌與出眾的身材吸引注目，最近她頻頻在社交平台上分享美照，讓粉絲們大飽眼福。早前她曾以冷艷的黑色連身裙形象亮相，展示不一樣的魅力。近日鄧凱文則回歸其標誌性的陽光甜美風格，換上一套日韓系穿搭，再次散發迷人的青春氣息。</p><figure><img alt=\"鄧凱文（Eris）一直以亮麗的外貌與出眾的身材吸引注目。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145798220526391296761839.jpeg/4UoTc2txmPNF-G9QkvuIrsYeP1ccQHGJq-8DMqvvAzI\"/><figcaption>鄧凱文（Eris）一直以亮麗的外貌與出眾的身材吸引注目。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><p>上身焦糖色細肩帶背心 下身低腰純白百褶迷你裙</p><p>照片中，鄧凱文穿著一件焦糖色細肩帶背心，外層覆以白色半透明網紗設計，為整體造型增添層次感。下身搭配一條低腰純白百褶迷你裙，進一步突顯了她的纖細長腿。她在貼文中分享道：「天氣熱或者下雨天都想待在家中，總括而言，整個夏天都想在家。」儘管表示想留守家中避暑，但Eris仍不忘打扮精緻，並大方分享靚照，讓粉絲們感受到她的感染力與熱情。</p><figure><img alt=\"Eris上身焦糖色細肩帶背心 下身低腰純白百褶迷你裙。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145798466610401280403267.jpeg/ENC1KaFfoK8m44NF_Gw81FJwlozOVnHYK6wcnSusHJ0\"/><figcaption>Eris上身焦糖色細肩帶背心 下身低腰純白百褶迷你裙。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"儘管表示想留守家中避暑，但鄧凱文仍不忘打扮精緻。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799944028950528502968.jpeg/eJM5MAFUrI0deaErm0z-nutf6OYCsrYiVGA0OFRgNDg\"/><figcaption>儘管表示想留守家中避暑，但鄧凱文仍不忘打扮精緻。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄧凱文大方分享靚照。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799941495459840041937.jpeg/dlTwcpEDU2DDvdQxDPZ71qOpHlhlWAsQkgsYZZILGGU\"/><figcaption>鄧凱文大方分享靚照。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"無論是冷艷成熟還是陽光甜美，鄧凱文能輕鬆駕馭不同風格。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799950551486464857309.jpeg/FrvXYY7PF6H-Auri87C5ec23-kBdbraBFu4jkBbuI5A\"/><figcaption>無論是冷艷成熟還是陽光甜美，鄧凱文能輕鬆駕馭不同風格。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄧凱文展現獨特的個人魅力。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799948500340736210386.jpeg/8FBM9qEjePiLPXbdlrwTjZebEsACkEDcDXqouw16qLs\"/><figcaption>鄧凱文展現獨特的個人魅力。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄧凱文呢個pose。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799946231091200095638.jpeg/q3f5btkhyuw38T68tmSdlL6aV41DCLyyCKXzpgil86Y\"/><figcaption>鄧凱文呢個pose。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄧凱文大方分享靚照。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799944192528384091328.jpeg/klRI9x-07WV6Kb2rW3z9rTNMCoBlaPImMCp-DTAqfg0\"/><figcaption>鄧凱文大方分享靚照。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄧凱文回歸其標誌性的陽光甜美風格。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799941814226944476095.jpeg/FCtYYpXGPTEj5BT45ntyrbp39ofFn-SoTIIJRkyCCUY\"/><figcaption>鄧凱文回歸其標誌性的陽光甜美風格。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄧凱文換上一套日韓系穿搭。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799950807339008934157.jpeg/OO-6iF4ZTBEWrSJhIEuU4F96Wa3uOsp3LTwSPS08Ej0\"/><figcaption>鄧凱文換上一套日韓系穿搭。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"儘管表示想留守家中避暑，但鄧凱文仍不忘打扮精緻。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799948546478080849135.jpeg/f0DUhP9UelAjeDa-CFLsnBrYNONsa1FWpVaVMaVWlTE\"/><figcaption>儘管表示想留守家中避暑，但鄧凱文仍不忘打扮精緻。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄧凱文整體造型增添層次感。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799946264645632347809.jpeg/CvNe0A9CRuD1-lPbGxTFp-bT7trV57juGgwYIhoMGCI\"/><figcaption>鄧凱文整體造型增添層次感。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"突顯了鄧凱文的纖細長腿。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799944100253696712684.jpeg/GZsW_nqkXG4zW9Z3bxVck1wrE7UsZpGfJYRStiWEUrY\"/><figcaption>突顯了鄧凱文的纖細長腿。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄧凱文。(ig@thm___)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145799941801644032048593.jpeg/Q_9J-yEZ8VqYRfqqJKztO0U6aeH17QL8eukFl3rpBZc\"/><figcaption>鄧凱文。(ig@thm___)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-23T05:22:11.817424+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":713,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}